window.products.push({"id":326062,"name":"Window Privacy Film Static Window Clings 3D Window Decals Rainbow Non-Adhesive Home Heat Control Window Stickers 17.5 x 78.7 Inches(Sequins)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sTxsOmFVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Key Features: Beautiful Patterns: Upgrade your home decor with unique patterns User-Friendly: Hassle-free peel-stick application in a breeze, easy removal leaving no damage or residue Glue Free: Simply use soapy water to install, no glue required Reusable: Premium material offers extra durability, can be re-positioned and reused repeatedly Semi-Private Window Film: Combine decoration and privacy protection. Package Included: 1 x Window Film Roll  Note: The window film works only on flat, clean, and smooth surfaces. It will not stick on plastic, broken, or uneven surfaces.  Window privacy film  Installation Instructions: Step 1. Keep Window or Glass clean and smooth. Step 2. Spray plenty of soapy water to wet glass, More Water More Easy Install. Step 3. Peel off the backing film (Important! Or the film will not stick). Step 4. Put the smooth side of the film onto the glass. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 6. Cut the extra window film. Step 7. More efficient in teamwork, no problems for you!  Some useful tips for you: When applying in cold weather: before installation, blow hot air to the film using a hairdryer to soften the film up (Heat Resistant up to 176℉) Affix a tape on a corner of the backside (the smooth side) to quickly remove the backing film.  FAQ: Q1: Why there are so many bubbles? A1: Too less water. Please tear it down and spray a lot of water, then apply window film again. Q2: Why edge of window film curling up? A2: The edge of the film is too close to the window. Please leave a small gap(about 1 cm )to press out water so that the window film can stick well. Q3: Why film can't stick well and fall? A3: Have not removed the transparent backing film. Please don't forget to remove the protective film or it will not cling. If you have removed the protective side, you may apply the wrong side. Please apply the smoot","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sTxsOmFVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dennyfu","source_asin":"B097GNB72P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097GNB72P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097GNB72P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
