window.products.push({"id":326095,"name":"Better Livin 10 Pc Glazed Ceramic Ramen Bowl Set (60oz) with 2 Bowls, 2 Spoons, 2 Chopsticks, 2 Holders, 2 Japanese Tea Cups for Ramen Noodles, Soup, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sRemNtgXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"10-PIECE SET WITH TEACUPS & CHOPSTICKS: Why splurge on expensive restaurants when you can have the fine dining experience right at home? With a set of two noodle bowls, soup spoons, real wooden chopsticks, spoon stands and Japanese teacups, you’ll have everything you need for the perfect Asian meal (or your favorite cereal if you’re having a lazy day!). LARGE 60 OZ. BOWL CAPACITY: Fill your bowl to the brim with all the toppings you can handle, with 60 oz. of soup space (20 oz. MORE than other bowls!). Slurp ramen, udon or pho from beautiful traditional bowls or skip the noodles and go for egg drop soup instead. Add soft-boiled eggs, perfectly braised pork and heaps of noodles for a bit of umami in every bite! CUSTOM SOUP SPOONS WITH HOOK: Never watch your spoon drown again with a custom hook design that keeps cutlery casualties to a minimum. The 6” spoon attaches perfectly to the rim of your bowl, so when you’re not drinking deliciously rich broth, it won’t sink in a sea of noodles. Plus, our ramen spoon is made of sturdy ceramic for better gripping and sipping! And an added benefit is the anti-skid base of the spoons which allows them to perfectly sit on the spoon and stand without slippage. PREMIUM FOOD-GRADE CERAMIC: Gloss, glaze and glamour -- that’s the ramen bowl charm! Our beautiful ceramic bowls, spoons and cups feature Under Glaze technology for food-safe suppers in traditional Asian style. Enjoy all of your favorite noodle soups, rice dishes and pasta in the gorgeous bowl and sip steamy green tea from the cups! DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE & FREEZER SAFE: Who knew one little bowl could do so much? Our extra large Japanese bowls aren’t just great for heaping servings of your favorite foods -- they’re microwave, freezer and dishwasher-safe, too! Freeze leftovers, nuke ‘em in the microwave and toss in the dishwasher after a belly-busting meal for super easy cleanup!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sRemNtgXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Livin","source_asin":"B08C8LH48T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C8LH48T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C8LH48T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
