window.products.push({"id":326129,"name":"HAUS AND HUES Boho Posters & Prints - 6 Piece Art, Nature Wall Prints, Neutral Art, Minimal Art Print, Modern Gallery Wall, Botanical Print, Plants Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Xu8xIcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOHO PRINTS WALL ART: These Matisse posters are the perfect way to add a touch of elegance to your home. The modern art wall decor includes floral patterns and doves that create a serene and beautiful scene that is perfect for any room. A gallery wall art set is a great way to fill a large space with simple wall art, and the boho wall art will complement any existing decor. BOTANICAL PRINTS: These plant prints would be perfect for a living room or bedroom. If you're looking for a unique way to decorate your home with coral wall art or beige wall art, this is the perfect piece for you! Our neutral wall art can be hung individually or together to create the perfect gallery wall art set. MADE IN THE USA: To achieve the quality we’re known for, we use a giclée printing technique on 14 pt semi-gloss paper. The recycled paper used for our boho art is sustainably-sourced in the US, and our inks are water-based and toxic-free. Trendy wall art is shipped in a durable mailer to protect the artwork while in transit so your botanical prints arrive in perfect condition. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our botanical prints are made in the US by our in-house team which ensures you will receive a high-quality product. We want you to shop our boho art wall decor with confidence, so we offer a hassle-free return and refund guarantee. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, let us know and we'll offer you a full refund or replacement. A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our bohemian wall art will make a great gift for friends and family. Give your loved ones these boho pictures wall decor for a birthday, housewarming, graduation, Christmas, or any special occasion. Our wall prints minimalist are a perfect way to add color and a personal touch to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814Xu8xIcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B0BG94M3PX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG94M3PX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG94M3PX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
