window.products.push({"id":326223,"name":"Fissler Blue Point 4.5 Quart Pressure Skillet without lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Gg-m-WEiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fissler Blue Point pressure cookers combine healthy nutrition with gentle cooking, since atmospheric oxygen is expelled and the cooking periods are quite short. Vitamins and minerals, as well as nutrients and flavor, are thus preserved. You can see and taste the difference. With Blue Point, you save up to 70% of the regular cooking time and as much as 50% of the energy traditionally used in cooking. Blue Point pressure cookers have two pressure levels, a gentle pressure level for cooking delicate food like vegetables and fish without destroying nutrients, and a speed pressure level for cooking meats and stews quickly. Blue Point pressure cookers are very unique in that they are completely silent. There is no unnerving rattling or hissing while pressure is inside. Once the oxygen is expelled and the valve locks into place, hardly any steam escapes into the air during the cooking process keeping the kitchen cooler. Because there is no steam, there are no cooking odors. Blue Point pressure cookers exceed the minimum safety requirements of Europe and the United States with patented innovative features such as the Euromatic safety valve, residual pressure block, interlocking lid, and automatic steam release. The CookStar all-stove base, comprised of a pure aluminum core and high-quality 18/10 stainless steel, ensures that the base that will never separate or warp. The energy-saving base also provides quick optimal heat distribution, diffusion, and storage without any hot spots. Safe for use on induction stoves and in the dishwasher. Limited lifetime warranty. Made in Germany.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Gg-m-WEiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fissler","source_asin":"B000TYUCNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TYUCNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TYUCNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326224,"name":"OXO Good Grips Stainless Steel Smooth Potato Masher, Black/Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9qkSRmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Get a smooth, powerful mash with the innovative OXO Good Grips Smooth Potato Masher. It’s designed with a broad, non-slip, horizontal handle that lets you press straight down and absorbs pressure, reducing strain even through pounds of potatoes. The fine-grid, stainless steel mashing plate yields lump-free mashed potatoes. This tool is also ideal for mashing yams, carrots, or other root vegetables as well as apples and bananas. Great for prepping homemade baby food. Dishwasher safe. Amazon.com What, no lumps? If you prefer the homemade texture of mashed root vegetables but without the chunks, this is the tool you've been searching for. With its broad, stainless-steel head, potatoes are mashed evenly through a fine grid. It's also great for other mashable vegetables and fruits, as well as for making baby food. The Good Grips line features durable, nonslip flexible handles on every product. Ergonomically designed to fit the palm comfortably and softly, the pressure-absorbing processed rubber handle puts less tension on the hands, while providing an outstanding grip. Made from the same material as dishwasher gaskets are constructed of, the handles are slip-proof, wet or dry, as well as dishwasher-safe. Good Grips products are moderately priced and have won the Tylenol/Arthritis Foundation Design Award. --Laurie Notaro","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9qkSRmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0002Z7OVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002Z7OVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002Z7OVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326225,"name":"DII Contemporary Reversible Indoor Area Rag Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yU4ubexiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ONE OF A KIND No two rugs are alike, each one is unique and special just for you. Made by hand from strips of recycled fabrics then lining them up repeatedly to create a beautiful, one of a kind rug. Be sure to place rug grip under rug to keep in place and act as a barrier between the floor and the rug, as this is a hand dyed product and colors may bleed. DII rag rugs are rich in a variety of colors are just dark enough to hide stains in between washing. DII rag rugs are the perfect rug for any shabby chic, up-cycled, or rustic style home. No two rugs are the same, so get one for your love ones, friends, and family. Protect your flooring in high traffic areas with these beautiful rag rugs. The colors are bright and fun adding a pop of color to your home. These nice rag rugs are a perfect way to complete the shabby chic look. No need to make your own rag rug, DII makes them for you! COMES IN ALL SHAPES AND SIZES Seven different sizes including two round rugs options and over 10 colors to choose from, we have the perfect rag rug for you. Need a runner for a hallway? Round area rug for a small sitting room or apartment? A rug for a laundry or mud room to dry off the bottom of shoes? A mat for the kitchen or under pet dishes? These rugs can be used for many different purposes and last a long time. Easy to clean and reversible for an extended life these rugs will add a vibrant color boost to any room Available sizes: 8x10' 8x10' 4x6' 4x6' 2x6' 2x6' 2x3' 2x3' 20x31.5\" 20x31.5\" 36\" Round 36\" Round 48\" Round 48\" Round QUALITY YOU CAN RELY ON Rugs contain a mix of recycled fabric and are made to withstand any conditions and are double sided for even longer life. Spot clean when needed. DO NOT PLACE NEAR HEAT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yU4ubexiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B0167NI1ZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0167NI1ZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0167NI1ZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326226,"name":"FINEBAT Grey Shower Curtain Liner 72 x 72, Non-Toxic Odor Free Plastic Waterproof 4G Lightweight Shower Liner for Bathroom, with Grommets Holes and 3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HjQ18x9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This shower curtain can be used as a shower liner or as a shower curtain alone, perfect for showers and tubs in homes, campers, hotels, dorms, and more. Package: shower curtain liner x1  Maintenance:  1. Wipe with a damp cloth until there are no water stains  2. Maintain good ventilation  3. If there are soap bubbles on it, we recommend cleaning it in time 4.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HjQ18x9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINEBAT","source_asin":"B09SKWW58J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SKWW58J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SKWW58J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326227,"name":"180 Pints Commercial Dehumidifiers for Basement, with Pump Drain Hose for Warehouse & Job Sites, Large Capacity Rotational Molded Portable Crawl Space","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-I9VK1YAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【180 PINTS DEHUMIDIFIER】This dehumidifier with 386 CFM airflow volume can remove up to 190 pints of moisture from the air per day at saturation (90°F, 90%) (93 PPD @ AHAM), ideal for flood & water damage restoration, carpet cleaning, fast drying in indoor gardening/greenhouse/pool/spa, construction areas, marine environments and large spaces up to 6,000 sq ft. 【DEHUMIDIFIER WITH PUMP】Featuring an internal heavy-duty condensate pump of 15 ft drain height connecting with a 17 ft wrinkle-free long drain hose (included), this self-draining industrial dehumidifier will automatically drain the condensation water to anywhere you want, meanwhile ensuring you are always on the top of operation without downtime. 【SUPER DURABLE】Roto-molded housing is much better on resisting dents, abrasion, and corrosion than metal housing while protecting the delicate interior components from any impact damage. This ETL listed water damage dehumidifier is also backed with a 2-year free warranty (5-year on housing) to ensure maximum lifespan that lasts several years. 【PLUG AND GO OPERATION】All you need to do is to plug it in, turn it on, no further manual adjustment is required. The LCD screen displays the humidity level and the temperature of both inlet and outlet as well as the job hours for better management of job site progress. The auto-restart on power failure and auto HGV defrost features allow less supervision. 【EASY TO TRANSPORT & STORE】The large semi-pneumatic wheels and rigid handle make this large dehumidifier portable from job sites to job sites, even from downstairs to upstairs. The long PVC drain hose (17 ft) and power cord (25 ft), adding ultimate flexibility for installation, can be wrapped on the winders on the back, the handle is foldable and the rugged housing is stackable, saving valuable spaces for both storage and transportation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-I9VK1YAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUKO","source_asin":"B0B63N8328","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63N8328","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63N8328","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
