window.products.push({"id":326264,"name":"Thick-bottomed Stainless Steel Steamer Pot 2 Tier Food Steamer for Cooking Multipurpose Cookware with Tempered Glass Lid for Vegetable, tamale,Dumplin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MlbsxCA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Free gift accessory】1.Anti-scalding silicone gloves. 2.Large stainless steel septa clamp. 3.Silicone pad. 4.Steamer pads for dumplings or bread. 【Thickened bottom pot】Made of high quality 304 stainless steel, the bottom is made of 3-layer energy-gathering composite material, which can effectively and evenly heated. 【Various combinations of pot】Consists of 1 large bottom pot, 1 steamer, 2 septa and 1 visible glass lid. It can be combined into: 1 layer(bottom pot with lid), 2 layers (bottom pot with septa and lid). 【Dishwasher Safe】Each part is easy to clean. Can be compatible with a variety of stoves, including induction, electric, gas and so on. 【Larger capacity】the bottom pot is up to 16 Quart, and each layer steamer can hold up to 5 Quart, suitable for 6-8 person meal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MlbsxCA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vividness","source_asin":"B09QBXN6GH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QBXN6GH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QBXN6GH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326265,"name":"Coo Candles Electric Candle Wax Melt Warmer or Oil Burner Lamp Combo - Stone Neptune","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LzOEL45tL._AC_SL1465_.jpg","description":"Our Stone Neptune lamp is one of our best selling lamps. It is a fragrance oil lamp that is designed for use with our Coo Candles soy wickless candles. It can also be used with oils and other waxes. For harder waxes such as paraffin, you will want to have the lamp on high to initially melt the wax thoroughly. Once melted you can adjust the lamp down. Simply break off one cube of wax, place it in the bowl at the top of the lamp, and the heat from the 35 Watt halogen light bulb will melt the wax and spread the scent. The lamp can be adjusted from low, to medium, to high, by a dimmer switch on the cord. This will adjust the light as well as the scent! Uses a 35 watt halogen bulb. Don't forget replacement bulbs! Search for Coo Candles Bulbs to ensure you are getting the correct ones - many of them look alike!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LzOEL45tL._AC_SL1465_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coo Candles","source_asin":"B07KHF1RF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KHF1RF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KHF1RF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
