window.products.push({"id":326318,"name":"Forschner/Victorinox 6\" Rosewood Handle Boning Knife, Straight, Narrow, Flexible, Model 40015","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-mP4Ia7OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The R.H. Forschner collection has grown in size and stature since its name was first carved in steel in 1855. Historically a premier choice of culinary professionals, it is still preferred by professionals today. Renowned for its extremely sharp, Swiss made, steel blades from Victorinox, R.H. Forschner provides professionals in food processing and preparation with superior quality, value-priced cutlery that enhances performance and increases productivity. They are manufactured in Switzerland. The renowned rosewood handles feature a carved handle design with the unique beauty of natural rosewood and are extra durable. The fibrox handles feature a non slip, ergonomic design and are NSF approved. The blades feature a high-carbon no stain steel with the unique Victorinox polished surface and a taper ground edge. The largest offering of boning shapes and styles in the entire industry. Did You Know: Use a narrow boning knife on ribs and chops to cut easily through bone and cartilage. Use a wide boning knife for chicken and pork. Use a curved boning knife for a better working angle when cutting close to and around the bone. A Granton edge, or \"kullenschiff\" edge, has hollowed out grooves on the sides of the blade. These grooves fill with the fat and juices of the product being sliced, which allows for thin, even cuts without tearing or shredding the meat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-mP4Ia7OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B0000CFDCI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFDCI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFDCI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
