window.products.push({"id":326479,"name":"King Italian Prestige Collection Striped Bed Sheet Set – 1800 Luxury Soft Microfiber Deep Pocket 4-Piece Bedding Set - Wrinkle, Stain, Fade Resistant ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hLqRelXCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"THE ITALIAN LUXURY YOU DESERVE – Made of Italian Double Brushed Microfiber, these luxurious sheets will keep your comforter protected while introducing an element of class and elegance in your home or hotel. Hotel-quality bedding is woven from the highest quality microfiber material, double brushed on both sides for ultimate softness and comfort. KING SIZE 4PC SET – Includes 1 Flat Top Sheet (102”x 105”) 1 Fitted Bottom Sheet (80”x 78”) 2 Standard Pillowcase (20”x 40”).Deep pocket sheets fit deep pocket 14 inch and 16 inch mattresses. Resistant to pilling and snagging, our bedding is pet-friendly and made to last. These are great for using with memory foam mattress toppers or mattress pads! FEEL THE DELUXE NATURE OF THESE BED COVERS – No wrinkles, No fading, no staining. The Italian Collection linen feature premium quality microfiber fabric that promises to be wrinkle, stain and fade resistant for a lifetime. A stretchable elastic all around the entire sheet ensures a tight, secure fit that won’t ride up or move around in middle of the night, staying smooth, snug and wrinkle-free. VERSATILE & EASY TO CARE FOR – Simply machine wash them on cold, then tumble dry low and you are all set. Lightweight, breathable and cool to the touch, our luxuriously soft bedding will create a serene sleeping experience, leaving you feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. Perfect for the master bedroom, kid’s room, guest room, RV, or your vacation home, these deluxe sheets will not disappoint. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED– Our Italian Collection luxurious bed sheets are destined to always feel fresh, smooth and lightweight even after dozens of washes. Our goal is to provide you with unparalleled customer service, and making our customers happy is our priority. You can shop with confidence because no matter we got you covered!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hLqRelXCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Italian Collection","source_asin":"B0145I1IZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0145I1IZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0145I1IZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
