window.products.push({"id":326620,"name":"Love's cabin King Size Quilt Set Umber Bedspreads - Soft Bed Summer Quilt Lightweight Microfiber Bedspread- Modern Style Coin Pattern Coverlet for All","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wdn1UyqkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUTSTANDING FEATURES: Year-round chic for the bed, Love's cabin Quilt Sets with Wave Pattern stitching lend sumptuous texture and subtle sophistication to your bed - Tight stitching or seams on the edging will hold up through washing and won't unravel for longer years to use - Lightweight, durable bedspread sets are perfect for family with pets or kids. DURABLE AND SOFT - Perfect for families with pets or children. Embroidered stitching will not unravel and allows for many years of continued use. Highest quality brushed microfiber and workmanship for long lasting comfort. MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE: Perfect coverlet quilt for summer or warmer weather, you can layer it with a blanket/sheet underneath - In the winter, you can add a comforter underneath - Using a quilt solo on your bed in your master room, guest room or vacation homes - If you have night sweats or toss and turn a lot, it is easy to move freely with this coverlet. PRODUCT FEATURES - King size (106\"x96\") 3 piece quilt set comes with a quilt and two shams (20\"x36\"). Super soft microfiber stitched in a mutilayered technique to create a lightweight, durable quilts for year-round comforts. Solid color allows for easy matching with home decor and bedspreads. DEDICATED CUSTOMER SERVICE: Love's cabin Trademarked Products - NO risk shopping. Love's cabin strives to provide 1-Month return and replacement service & life-time free customer service - We want our customers to be 100% happy and satisfied!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wdn1UyqkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love's cabin","source_asin":"B0859YNTXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859YNTXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859YNTXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326621,"name":"Dworth 2 Piece Ceramic Knife Set , 6\" Chef Knife/ Vegetable Knife / Fruit Knife , Kitchen Knives with Case (Knife Sheaths) (2, black+blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZlTePYRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dworth ceramic knife is made out of zirconium oxide, a high quality, ceramic material which has been developed in the medical and space sectors. Our product work very well. It is considered the very best existing material for knives. The blade stays sharp about ten times longer and is about one third lighter than steel knives.Always extremely sharp. The knife allows one to make exceptionally clean and accurate cuts and offers a comfortable hold with its soft touch handle. Fruit, vegetables and meats without the bone may be cut with the slightest effort.And the blade is extremely hard almost as hard as the diamond and does not change the taste of food and gives it no smell. It is hygienic, non-allergenic, corrosion resistant a n magnetic. Also food does not stick to it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZlTePYRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dworth","source_asin":"B01EN1LZWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EN1LZWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EN1LZWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
