window.products.push({"id":326731,"name":"HEUNGBERANT Wood Stove Fan Wood Burning Stove Fan Heat Powered Fireplace Fan for Wood/Log Burner/Fireplace (updated I shape with thermometer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bTXie5VqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why need to use the stove fan Without a wood stove fan, a lot of heat generated by a stove is lost as the air rises directly vertically. However, our heat powered stove fan uses its blades to divert the warm air horizontally filling the whole room as opposed to the area directly between the stove and the ceiling!Specifications: Package included: a wood burning stove fan + a magnetic mhermometer Size: 8.3inchX 4.9inchX 8.3inch Recommended operating temperature: 80-250DegreeC, please remove the wood stove fan from the stove if the temperature exceeds 350ºC (662ºF). Never place the wood burning stove fan on an unprotected surface if the fan base is still hot. To move or carry the stove fan, always use the extendable handle while wearing gloves. Please ensure children and pets are supervised around your stove and the wood stove fan blower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bTXie5VqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEUNGBERANT","source_asin":"B099FJL25C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099FJL25C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099FJL25C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":326732,"name":"NOVICA Purple and Yellow Sun and 2 Crescent Moon Large Painted Steel Wall Art Indoor Outdoor Decor, Beloved Sun'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":191.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybnWwLrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Crescent moons welcome the bright presence of the sun in an outdoor wall art sculpture of exceptional artistry. Mexico's Alejandro de Esesarte hand crafts the original steel wall art sculpture, which he paints by hand with colors of intense beauty. - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly About our Artist: 'From the time I was a boy, I was attracted to art, ' recalls Alejandro de Esesarte. 'When I was 20, I became an ecologist and defender of nature, and this is when I began to create animals in metal. My technique is similar to cutout metal, but more rudimentary. From this, I became inspired and started working in metal for its versatility. Today I have a workshop, a cockatoo named Coco and a cactus collection. Those are all the tools I need to continue working. '","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybnWwLrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01K0BMWJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K0BMWJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K0BMWJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
