window.products.push({"id":326894,"name":"Glotoch 48 Pack 16 oz. (2 Cups) Plastic Food and Drink Storage Containers Set with Lids - Microwave, Freezer & Dishwasher Safe Eco-Friendly, BPA-Free,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xJ94SFQPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"48-Pack To Go Containers: Glotoch 16 oz Soup Containers come in a set of 48. Perfect for use as deli containers, soup containers or food prep containers. These plastic containers with lids encourage a diet with healthy portions and variety. Glotoch plastic containers are also perfect for party supplies, lunch boxes, and more! Premium Quality Deli Containers: Glotoch Deli Containers are made of BPA-free, food-grade PP plastic. Can withstand temperatures from -40°F to 250°F or (-40°C to 120°C). Manufactured via injection molding to ensure a leak-proof, tight seal for your meals or snacks. Snap-lock lid keeps your food, soup, yogurt, dessert, or drinks fresh and secure. Easy-open lids allow easy packing and easy meals on the go! Helps Food Organization: Keep your meals and leftovers organized in your fridge with Glotoch food storage containers. They're freezer, dishwasher, and microwave safe. They're easy to clean and are reusable. Do all the meal preparation ahead of time so you can relax and enjoy the best part of the meal - eating! Time and Money Saver: Glotoch airtight food storage containers are perfect for storing your food right in the original packaging. Featuring a unique press and seal locking lid. You'll never have to worry about spills. Each container comes with an easy-open tab for your convenience. Quality Assurance. If, for any reason, our Glotoch food storage containers do not meet your needs, don't hesitate to get in touch with our customer service team. We offer quick and hassle-free assistance to resolve any issues that may arise!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xJ94SFQPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glotoch Express","source_asin":"B07DZGXJW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-326894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DZGXJW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DZGXJW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
